@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### admin only (login as admin@sdp.test)

### audit trail (append-only). Filters: entityType (TICKET, ASSET, KB_ARTICLE, USER),
### entityRef (e.g. TKT-2026-00001), action (e.g. TICKET_CLAIM, LOGIN), actor (user id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin-api/audit-logs?limit=20

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin-api/audit-logs?entityRef=PASTE_TICKET_PUBLIC_ID

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin-api/audit-logs?entityType=USER&action=LOGIN

### a malformed actor id -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin-api/audit-logs?actor=nope

### anyone who is not an admin -> 403 (login as employee@sdp.test and repeat the first request)

### notifications: a malformed id -> 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/notification-api/mark-read/not-an-id
